    },
    {
      "id": "sRBw10oWZd37KVETF9Vp0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1181.2641143798828,
      "y": 510,
      "width": 297.4717712402344,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ae",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1577782064,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1342647248,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793982336140,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "OpaqueNames\nopaque.eth's subregistry + resolver\nclaim(label) only if:\ncodehash == PQAccount clone\n3–32 characters · one name per wallet\nelse NotAnOpaqueAccount · BadLabel\n· Taken · HasAName",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "y-x24sAQhRdJwe5lPbGxG",
      "originalText": "OpaqueNames\nopaque.eth's subregistry + resolver\nclaim(label) only if:\ncodehash == PQAccount clone\n3–32 characters · one name per wallet\nelse NotAnOpaqueAccount · BadLabel\n· Taken · HasAName",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7gj4ToakqzIzSnrGICVK_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1780.568115234375,
      "y": 530,
      "width": 258.86376953125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "af",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 685909296,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2016295216,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793982336140,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So a name resolves to an\naccount only a hash-based key\ncan move. An ECDSA write to\nthe resolver, and the old\nowner's setResolver, both revert.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "159lOYz1IznXv87DUhjgj",
      "originalText": "So a name resolves to an\naccount only a hash-based key\ncan move. An ECDSA write to\nthe resolver, and the old\nowner's setResolver, both revert.",
